  "title": "Bytes vs text",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## A Buffer is bytes\n\n`Buffer.from(\"café\", \"utf8\")` stores the UTF-8 bytes. `.toString(\"utf8\")` turns those bytes back into text. `.length` on a Buffer is the byte count, not the number of letters you see.\n\nThe letter `é` is often two UTF-8 bytes. So `\"café\"` is 5 bytes: `c`, `a`, `f`, and two for `é`.\n\nA fox tag painted `café` on the desk is four letters on the glass and five bytes in the log file. Print that byte length (`5`)."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "byte-len",
      "promptMd": "`Buffer.byteLength(\"é\", \"utf8\")` is…",
      "kind": "mcq",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "one",
          "md": "`1`"
        },
        {
          "id": "two",
          "md": "`2` (typical UTF-8)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "two"
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "id": "byte-vs-char",
      "kind": "cloze",
      "promptMd": "`Buffer.byteLength` counts {{a}}. `\"é\"` in UTF-8 is typically {{b}} byte(s).",
      "blanks": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "bytes",
              "md": "bytes"
            },
            {
              "id": "letters on screen",
              "md": "letters on screen"
            },
            {
              "id": "argv flags",
              "md": "argv flags"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "md": "1"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "md": "2"
            },
            {
              "id": "0",
              "md": "0"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "answer": {
        "a": "bytes",
        "b": "2"
      },
      "explainMd": "Letters you see and bytes on disk are not the same count. café is 4 letters and 5 UTF-8 bytes."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "byte-length",
      "engine": "javascript",
      "entry": "main.js",
      "promptMd": "> Print `Buffer.byteLength(\"café\", \"utf8\")`.",
